---
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="kicker mono rv">
      <span class="k-sq" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>PRODUCT ENGINEER</span>
      <span class="k-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>MARINE CORPS VETERAN</span>
      <span class="k-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>INDEPENDENT AI TOOL BUILDER</span>
    </p>

    <h1 class="hero-title split" data-split>
      <span class="line">FROM CRAYONS</span>
      <span class="line lime">TO CODE<span class="cursor blink" aria-hidden="true">_</span></span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-hook rv">
      Marine Corps logistics, recruiting pipelines, serverless scale, on-device AI:
      twenty years of translating complexity into systems people actually use.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <!-- departure-board dossier -->
      <dl class="board mono rv" aria-label="Dossier">
        <div class="board-row board-head">
          <span>DOSSIER</span><span>A. ROBIDA // EST. 1986</span>
        </div>
        <div class="board-row"><dt>ROLE</dt><dd>PRODUCT ENGINEER &amp; SYSTEMS ARCHITECT</dd></div>
        <div class="board-row"><dt>SERVICE</dt><dd>US MARINE CORPS, 12 YRS, LOGISTICS</dd></div>
        <div class="board-row"><dt>STATUS</dt><dd class="lime">INDEPENDENT, AI / LOCAL-FIRST TOOLS</dd></div>
        <div class="board-row"><dt>BANNER</dt><dd>&ldquo;HELPFUL, NOT ADDICTIVE&rdquo;</dd></div>
        <div class="board-row"><dt>ROUTE</dt><dd>PARADE DECK &rarr; DEPLOYMENT PIPELINE</dd></div>
      </dl>

      <div class="host-brief rv" data-offset="1">
        <p>
          This is an interview you conduct yourself. Below are <strong>eleven prompts</strong>,
          the ones you&rsquo;d ask if you sat down with him. Pick any, in any order,
          and Andrew answers in his own words.
        </p>
        <a href="#journey" class="cta mono">
          START WITH THE STORY <span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 5.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-grid-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 9%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 9%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 72px 72px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black, transparent 75%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black, transparent 75%);
  }
  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .kicker {
    display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--sage); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }
  .k-sq {
    width: 9px; height: 9px;
    background: var(--lime);
  }
  .k-sep {
    width: 1px; height: 0.9em;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 45%, transparent);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 10vw, 8.25rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }
  .hero-title .line { display: block; }
  .hero-title .lime { color: var(--lime); }
  .cursor { font-weight: 400; }

  .hero-hook {
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--sage);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .board {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 40%, transparent);
    font-size: clamp(0.66rem, 1.2vw, 0.78rem);
  }
  .board-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 25%, transparent);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .board-row:not(.board-head):hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--lime) 4%, transparent); }
  .board-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .board-row span, .board-row dt, .board-row dd {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .board-row dt {
    color: var(--sage);
    border-right: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 25%, transparent);
  }
  .board-row dd { margin: 0; }
  .board-head { background: var(--lime); }
  .board-head span { color: var(--ink) !important; font-weight: 600; border-color: var(--ink) !important; }

  .host-brief p {
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .host-brief strong { color: var(--lime); font-weight: 600; }
  .cta {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--lime); color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease-pop);
  }
  .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .cta:active { transform: translateY(-1px) scale(0.98); }
  .cta-arrow { transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-pop); }
  .cta:hover .cta-arrow { transform: translateY(3px); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { padding-top: 6.5rem; justify-content: flex-start; }
    .hero-bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .board-row { grid-template-columns: 84px 1fr; }
    .board-row span, .board-row dt, .board-row dd { white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>
